# CineHub Release Keystore Configuration Example
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions:
# 1. Generate your release keystore using keytool:
#    keytool -genkey -v -keystore my-upload-key.jks -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 -alias upload
#
# 2. Place "my-upload-key.jks" in the root directory of this project (or specify an absolute path).
#
# 3. Create a file named "keystore.properties" in the project root with the values below
#    (DO NOT commit keystore.properties or .jks files to Git):
#
# KEYSTORE_PATH=my-upload-key.jks
# STORE_PASSWORD=YourSecureKeystorePasswordHere
# KEY_ALIAS=upload
# KEY_PASSWORD=YourSecureKeyPasswordHere
#
# Or set them as environment variables in your CI/CD (GitHub Actions / Cloud Build):
# export KEYSTORE_PATH="/path/to/my-upload-key.jks"
# export STORE_PASSWORD="YourSecureKeystorePasswordHere"
# export KEY_PASSWORD="YourSecureKeyPasswordHere"
